      "name": "Our Story Founders",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Fuelling the Future of Cellular Nutrition",
        "content": "<p>Amino Forge is the brainchild of Ashim Matthan and Dr. Kanishka Jain born from a simple question — Why aren’t amino acids absorbed efficiently, even when we consume the best supplements?</p><p><br/>Amino acids are the foundation of life — vital for muscle repair, energy, and recovery. Yet, most supplements fail to deliver results because proteins and amino acids are hard to digest, especially for those on medications that impair nutrient absorption.</p><p><br/>That’s where liposomal technology provided the breakthrough. Used for decades in advanced drug and chemo delivery, liposomes encapsulate nutrients in a phospholipid layer — protecting them from stomach acid, maintaining alkaline pH, and dramatically enhancing absorption.</p><p><br/>After years of research, Ashim Matthan and Dr. Kanishka Jain discovered that no one in India had ever applied this delivery system to essential amino acids. This led to the creation of Amino Forge — a unique blend of all 9 essential amino acids in liposomal form.<br/><br/></p>",
        "right_bottom_img": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_497.png"
      }
